Misﬁt between physical aﬀectedness and regulatory embeddedness: The
case of drinking water supply along the Rhine River
Karin Ingolda,b,c,⁎, Andreas Moserd, Florence Metza,c, Laura Herzoga,f, Hans-Peter Badere,
Ruth Scheideggere, Christian Stammd
a Institute of Political Science Research, University of Bern, Switzerland
b Environmental Social Science Department, Swiss Federal Institute of Aquatic Science and Technology (Eawag), Switzerland
c Oeschger Centre for Climate Change Research, University of Bern, Switzerland
d Environmental Chemistry, Swiss Federal Institute of Aquatic Science and Technology (Eawag), Switzerland
e Systems Analysis, Integrated Assessment and Modelling, Swiss Federal Institute of Aquatic Science and Technology (Eawag), Switzerland
