wireless stations in 1955 initially under the control of the Ministry of External 
Affairs, GoI which were subsequently handed over to the Royal Government of 
Bhutan. The data is utilized by the Central Water Commission, India for flood 
forecasting. This scheme is currently inactive. 
3 The 1979 scheme focuses on hydro-meteorological data collection and flood 
