infrastructure, and harmonized legal and regulatory framework as 
major challenges for regional integration. Singh et al. (2018) cite ob­
stacles such as national-level sectoral policies, lack of trust among the 
countries, perceived threat to national safety, energy security and 
economic and political sovereignty, and inability of national govern­
