Projecting conflict risk in transboundary river basins by 2050 
following different ambition scenarios
Sophie Pieternel de Bruin
a,b, Susanne Schmeier
c, Rens van Beek
d 
and Marijn Gulpen
e
aInstitute for Environmental Studies, Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam, Amsterdam, the Netherlands; bPBL 
Netherlands Environmental Assessment Agency, The Hague, the Netherlands; cWater Governance 
